msgctxt "92"
msgid "Have you ever been to the Diet building?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I went there on a field trip when I was in grade school. Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's just that whenever I see it on the news, it's always just a bunch "
"of politicians arguing with one another."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Sometimes I think it'd be easier if they just had them all duke it out, pro "
"wrestling style. You feel me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I think I know what you mean. It's almost as if all they do is shout "
"at each other, and nothing ever gets done."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "In a way, the incident with the dump truck was kind of refreshing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"I mean, I don't condone what they did by any means, but it does seem like "
"you have to pull a stunt like that if you wanna make an impression nowadays."
msgstr ""

